<title>USA: Victoria Enterprises ends merger talks.</title>
<headline>Victoria Enterprises ends merger talks.</headline>
<dateline>BELLINGHAM, Wash. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Victoria Enterprises Inc Wednesday said it has terminated merger discussions with BioQuest Inc of Houston.</p>
<p>In a brief statement, the company did not give a reason for the decision.</p>
<p>In October, Victoria said it entered a letter of intent to acquire BioQuest Inc.  The agreement called for Victoria to exchange 4,000,000 of its restricted common shares for 100 percent of BioQuest's shares.</p>
